## Technical Feasibility & Recommended Architecture

| Layer                  | Technology Suggestions                     | Notes                                                               |
|------------------------|---------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Front-End              | React Native / Flutter                      | Mobile-first, high-performance UI                                   |
| Back-End               | Node.js + Express / Python + FastAPI        | Scalable REST/GraphQL API                                           |
| Database               | PostgreSQL (profiles, interests)            | ACID compliance for user data                                       |
| Real-Time Messaging    | WebSockets (Socket.IO / Phoenix Channels)   | Instant posts, comments, and notifications                          |
| Blockchain Integration | Solidity on Ethereum/L2 or Polygon          | Mint your own token, handle on-chain rewards                        |
| VR Support             | Unity + WebXR / Three.js                    | Embed WebVR scenes inside the mobile app                            |
| Anonymity Layer        | Ephemeral identifiers + end-to-end encryption | Separate “Civilized” auth from “Free” anonymous sessions            |
| Gamification Engine    | Custom rules engine in back-end             | Points, badges, level-ups, milestone celebrations                   |

