## Step-by-Step Roadmap to Clone for HYPERFOCUSzone.com

1. Define Scope & MVP
   - List must-have features (e.g., two worlds, exploration UI, basic token).

2. UI/UX Prototyping
   - Sketch wireframes for mobile exploration, feeds, and worlds toggle.
   - Validate flows with neurodivergent test users (your target audience).

3. Back-End Foundation
   - Stand up database schemas for profiles, interests, tokens, VR scenes.
   - Build authentication service supporting both identified and anonymous users.

4. Front-End Development
   - Implement explore tab with pinch-zoom + swipe gestures.
   - Create interest feed components (text, images, video).

5. Token & Blockchain Setup
   - Deploy smart contracts for your HYPE token.
   - Integrate token wallet UI, on-chain reward distribution.

6. VR Module (Optional for Beta)
   - Embed basic WebXR viewer for a sample “space.”
   - Plan incremental VR feature rollout based on user feedback.

7. Gamification & Rewards
   - Craft point system for posts, swipes, referrals.
   - Build dashboard for users to track levels, badges, and token earnings.

8. QA, Security & Compliance
   - Pen-test API, review smart contracts for vulnerabilities.
   - Ensure GDPR- and CCPA-style data protections.

9. Beta Launch & Iteration
   - Release to a small cohort of ADHD- and neurodivergent users.
   - Collect feedback, iterate UI, adjust tokenomics.

10. Full Launch & Marketing
    - Reserve “spaces” for early adopters and influencers.
    - Gamify onboarding with dopamine-driven rituals and celebratory loops.

