## Challenges & Considerations

- Intellectual Property
  - You must avoid copying Uhive’s actual code, assets, or trademarks.

- Scalability
  - Real-time feeds and VR content demand robust infrastructure (load balancers, CDNs).

- Tokenomics Design
  - Balance supply, rewards, and utility to prevent hyperinflation.

- User Safety & Moderation
  - Decentralized moderation protocols to handle abuse in the anonymous world.

- Neurodivergent Inclusivity
  - Ensure UI choices (colors, animations, feedback) don’t overwhelm users with ADHD or sensory sensitivities.

