- **Modular Plugin System**: Let third-party devs launch mini-apps (“spaces”) inside your ecosystem—NFT galleries, micro-games, study rooms.

By following this blueprint and layering in your ADHD-friendly gamification expertise, you’ll be well on your way to launching HYPERFOCUSzone.com as a next-gen, neurodivergent-first social platform.


